OL,3,GNEWSAA38 safety upgrades criticised as
OL,4,A'half-baked'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for safety upgrades to improve
OL,7,Fconditions at a dangerous junction have
OL,8,Fbeen criticised as a "half-baked
OL,9,Fsolution" by campaigners.
OL,11,FNational Highways announced plans to
OL,12,Fremove a series of right hand turns on
OL,13,Fthe A38 in Cornwall between Liskeard
OL,14,Fand Trerulefoot after a number of
OL,15,Ffatalities.
OL,17,FThe campaign group Safe38 welcomed
OL,18,Fsafety improvements but warned it could
OL,19,Fforce local traffic to use unsuitable
OL,20,Flanes and lead to inappropriate
OL,21,FU-turns.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
