OL,3,GNEWSAA38 safety upgrades criticised as
OL,4,A'half-baked'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways said the scheme would
OL,7,F"make a difference and improve safety"
OL,8,Fwhile alternative proposals were "very
OL,9,Fexpensive".
